=2 Walkthrough
* Talk to {n:Duberasson} at (H-11) in {z:Western Adoulin} (he is near the residential area, right next to {p:Eternal Flame}, the NPC who deals in Sparks).
* Talk to {n:Nantoto} at (H-8) in {z:Lower Jeuno}. Nantoto will offer various letters. Select the "Silver Envelope".
* Obtain a {@i:Starfall Tear|546} {i:Starfall Tear|Starfall Tear|546}, {@i:Siren's Tear|576} {i:Siren's Tear|Siren's Tear|576}, and {@i:Ahriman Tears|921} {i:Ahriman Tears|Ahriman Tears|921}.
** {@i:Starfall Tear|546} {i:Starfall Tear|Starfall Tear|546} is obtained by trading a single {@i:Pugil Scales|868} {i:Pugil Scales|Pugil Scales|868} to the {p:Twinkle Tree} at (I-6) in {z:West Sarutabaruta} between the hours of 0:00 and 3:00.
** {@i:Siren's Tear|576} {i:Siren's Tear|Siren's Tear|576} is obtained by touching the ??? along the bank of the {p:Obere Creek} at (J-8) and (J-9) in {z:North Gustaberg} with no main or sub weapons equipped. Once touched, the ??? moves to another random spot along the bank.
** {@i:Ahriman Tears|921} {i:Ahriman Tears|Ahriman Tears|921} is obtained from {n:Odoba} in the Alchemist's Guild. You must be Initiate rank or higher to purchase it.
* Travel to the {q:Luck Rune|Luck Rune|Luck Rune} located at the southeast corner of (H-7) (lower cliff) in {z:Beaucedine Glacier}.
* Trade the three tears to the {q:Luck Rune|Luck Rune|Luck Rune} to complete the objective.

